# Anchored to repo root (leading /) -- the bare `lib/`/`lib64/` this
# generic Python template ships with matches at ANY depth, which was
# silently swallowing frontend/src/lib/ (Server Actions, JWT signing,
# shared types -- 6 files) from git entirely since the initial commit.
# Found during the 2026-08-26 cleanup pass; see CLAUDE.md's decision log.
